        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65]">This guide is based on Meta&rsquo;s published documentation for Partnership Ads (formerly Branded Content Ads), observed campaign performance data across multiple verticals, and cross-platform comparison data with TikTok Spark Ads. Performance benchmarks (engagement rate lifts, CTR improvements, conversion rate gains) are directional ranges observed across campaigns and should not be taken as guarantees. Individual results depend on creator selection, content quality, targeting, product-market fit, and competitive dynamics. Meta&rsquo;s ad platform features and policies are subject to change.</p>
